CoreWeave Inference Cookbook patch for NeMo-RL (https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL)
Base: tag v0.7.0
Purpose: add the `coreweave` generation backend to grpo.setup() (policy cluster only, the cwtrain
  worker extension, the hot-load weight synchronizer), let refit_policy_generation hand
  over to that synchronizer, and keep print_performance_metrics working when generation
  owns no GPUs in the training cluster.
License: Apache-2.0. Upstream code by NVIDIA CORPORATION; changes by CoreWeave, Inc. (see REUSE.toml).
Applied by training/recipes/nemo-rl/launch.py with `git apply`, which skips this header.

